hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18057","Ismail ibn Ibrahim narrated to us from al-Jurayri from Abu al-Ala ibn al-Shikhkhir that Uthman said: O Messenger of Allah, Satan came between me and my prayer and between my recitation. He said: That is a devil called Khanzab, so when you sense him, seek refuge in Allah from him and spit to your left three times. He said: Then I did that, and Allah Almighty removed him from me."
"18058","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, Sufyan informed us from Said al-Jurayri from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn al-Shikhkhir from Uthman ibn Abi al-As al-Thaqafi, he said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, Satan came between, and he mentioned its meaning."
